<h1>दाखिला फाराम (आयोजना तर्फ)</h1>
<table class="table table-bordered">
  <tr>
    <th>दाखिला मिति</th>
    <th>दाखिला नं </th>
    <th>विल नं</th>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><%= ndate @project_purchase_entry.entry_date %></td>
    <td><%= nd @project_purchase_entry.entry_no %></td>
    <td><%= @project_purchase_entry.bill_no %></td>
  </tr>
</table>
<div class="separator"></div>
<div class="text-center">
  <%= link_to back_btn.html_safe, project_purchase_entries_path %>
  <%= link_to edit_big_btn.html_safe, edit_project_purchase_entry_path(@project_purchase_entry) %>
  <% if @project_purchase_entry.marked_as_final != true %>
  <%= link_to final_btn.html_safe, edit_project_purchase_entry_path(@project_purchase_entry) %>
    <% end %>
  <% if can_unmark(@project_purchase_entry) %>
  <%= link_to before_final_btn.html_safe, edit_project_purchase_entry_path(@project_purchase_entry) %>
    <%end %>
  <%= link_to print_big_btn.html_safe, edit_project_purchase_entry_path(@project_purchase_entry) %>

</div>
<div class="separator"></div>
<h2>दाखिला गर्नुपर्ने सामान प्रविष्ट गर्ने</h2>


